      "writtenOn": "2022-10-10T18:46:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ES2 can be evaluated on hardware without any control flow; for loops are unrolled, both sides of if statements are evaluated (results from the false side are discarded), you can\u0027t read arrays from a non-constant index, etc. AFAIK ES2 shouldn\u0027t ever be in a place where the gradient for a sample call can\u0027t be determined.",
